{"c":[{"name":"20261023T040809Z-c22f9b609db9aad0","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: a released migration may gain or change comments (#128 added @rel lines to 0001 and 0007); its SQL may never change to do something materially different. A make ci/CI gate compares released migrations' SQL, comments stripped, to the latest tag.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T042410Z-e369216e79b70d78","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 without vss, file with the HNSW index (2026-10-22): explicit CHECKPOINT after ALTER, INSERT, or CREATE VIEW raises FatalException (Cannot bind index); a plain close checkpoints fine. Runner 0004-0009, a kill mid-chain, tiny checkpoint_threshold: all reach 9.","type":"note"}]}
